<p class="muted">Tivoli Guesthouse · Administration</p><h1>Staff and access</h1><p>Manage staff, roles and privileges. Changes require your password and a reason, and are recorded in the audit trail.</p>
<nav class="app-section-nav" aria-label="Page sections"><a href="#staff">Staff</a><a href="#roles">Roles</a><a href="#privileges">Privileges</a></nav>
